{#
    The counterpart of `admin/company/_address_card_body.html.twig`. `address` is a VendorAddress
    entity (not a row array — company's own partial reads a row array shaped for the CUSTOMER
    screen's flatter data; the vendor screen has no such row builder and reads the entity directly,
    the way the rest of this bundle's address forms already do).

    Every field read below — companyName, contactName, emailPrimary, emailSecondary, fax, phone —
    is declared once on `App\Entity\AbstractPartyAddress`, the mapped superclass both
    `App\Entity\CompanyAddress` and `VendorAddress` extend (#635). That shared vocabulary is why
    this partial and the customer's read the same field names for the same concepts despite two
    separate tables; only the FK and the "what is this address FOR" flags differ by side, which is
    also why this partial cannot simply BE the customer one — that one is shaped for a row array,
    not an entity, and reads two default flags where a vendor address carries four purposes.

    Params: address (VendorAddress|null), vendor (Vendor), compact (bool)
#}
{% if address %}
    <div class="address-card-body">
        <dl class="address-detail-list">
            <div>
                <dt>Company Name</dt>
                <dd>{{ address.companyName ?: vendor.name }}</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
                <dt>Contact</dt>
                <dd>{{ address.contactName ?: '-' }}</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
                <dt>Email</dt>
                <dd>{{ address.emailPrimary ?: '-' }}</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
                <dt>Secondary Email</dt>
                <dd>{{ address.emailSecondary ?: '-' }}</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
                <dt>Fax</dt>
                <dd>{{ address.fax ?: '-' }}</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
                <dt>Phone Number</dt>
                <dd>{{ address.phone ?: '-' }}</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="address-lines">
                <dt>Address</dt>
                <dd>{{ address.toSnapshot|nl2br }}</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
                <dt>Purposes</dt>
                <dd>{{ address.purposeLabels is empty ? '-' : address.purposeLabels|join(', ') }}</dd>
            </div>
        </dl>
        <div class="address-card-actions">
            <a href="{{ path('admin_bundle_procurement_vendor_address_form', {id: vendor.id, address: address.id}) }}">Edit</a>
            {% if not compact %}
                <button class="link-button js-delete" type="submit" form="delete-address-{{ address.id }}">Delete</button>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>
{% else %}
    <div class="address-card-body address-card-empty">
        <p>No address selected yet.</p>
        <a class="button primary company-card-action" href="{{ path('admin_bundle_procurement_vendor_address_form', {id: vendor.id}) }}">Add Address</a>
    </div>
{% endif %}
